.idea
# The local dev build at the root.
/dispat
dispat.*.backup
node_modules

# Where every package's `tests` script writes its coverage profile, and where
# the release workflow merges them from. Output, regenerated by every run.
/coverage

# The credential file google-github-actions/auth writes into the workspace. It
# can mint the releaser's credentials for as long as the job runs, and the
# release's worker machine receives a snapshot of this checkout through the
# repository, so it must never be a file Git would carry.
gha-creds-*.json
